  "abstract": "Single\u2011variable sweep from p=36\u219234 with V\u2011normalized Hybrid TrendMix; all else unchanged. Tests capacity sweet\u2011spot for combining oscillatory SSM and low\u2011freq trend under LN\u2011after\u2011gating.",
